ASET-SEED 1 ASET-SEED-0.4-ALPHA 0.4alpha
COMPATIBILITY 0.3 NONE
DIGEST-ROLE BYTE_IDENTITY_AND_CACHE_ONLY
SEMANTIC-PRECEDENCE NONE

THEORY-ALGEBRA theory/local-recognition/formal/LocalRecognitionAlgebra.tla
THEORY-CODING U UNKNOWN A ALLOW B BLOCK
ABSTRACT-MACHINE seed/alpha4/operational/components.forth
FORMAL-REFLECTION seed/alpha4/formal/RestrictedOperationalSemantics.tla
CORRECTNESS-MODEL seed/alpha4/formal/ComponentRelations.tla
CAUSAL-MODEL seed/alpha4/causal/components.petri

PAIR ASET-COMPONENT-OBSERVE-UNKNOWN OBSERVE-UNKNOWN ObserveUnknown ObserveUnknownPairing
PAIR ASET-COMPONENT-RECOGNIZE-ALLOW RECOGNIZE-ALLOW RecognizeAllow RecognizeAllowPairing
PAIR ASET-COMPONENT-RECOGNIZE-BLOCK RECOGNIZE-BLOCK RecognizeBlock RecognizeBlockPairing
PAIR ASET-COMPONENT-PRESERVE-UNKNOWN PRESERVE-UNKNOWN PreserveUnknown PreserveUnknownPairing
PAIR ASET-COMPONENT-PRESERVE-ALLOW PRESERVE-ALLOW PreserveAllow PreserveAllowPairing
PAIR ASET-COMPONENT-PRESERVE-BLOCK PRESERVE-BLOCK PreserveBlock PreserveBlockPairing

CAUSAL-BIND ASET-COMPONENT-OBSERVE-UNKNOWN OBSERVE-UNKNOWN
CAUSAL-BIND ASET-COMPONENT-RECOGNIZE-ALLOW RECOGNIZE-ALLOW
CAUSAL-BIND ASET-COMPONENT-RECOGNIZE-BLOCK RECOGNIZE-BLOCK
CAUSAL-BIND ASET-COMPONENT-PRESERVE-UNKNOWN PRESERVE-UNKNOWN
CAUSAL-BIND ASET-COMPONENT-PRESERVE-ALLOW PRESERVE-ALLOW
CAUSAL-BIND ASET-COMPONENT-PRESERVE-BLOCK PRESERVE-BLOCK

FOUNDATION-MODEL theory/local-recognition/formal/RecognitionCardinality.tla
FOUNDATION-PROOF theory/local-recognition/formal/RecognitionCardinalityProofs.tla ThreeRecognitionValuesAreCardinalityMinimal 14
PROOF COMPONENT_COMPOSITION seed/alpha4/formal/ComponentCompositionProofs.tla RecognizedTransitionsPreserveExactSubjectAndAuthority 22
PROOF OPERATIONAL_RELATIONAL_PAIRING seed/alpha4/formal/OperationalRelationalPairingProofs.tla OperationalRelationalPairing 13

CHECK ASSURANCE tools/alpha4_assurance.py
CHECK RELEASE_CONGRUENCE tools/alpha4_congruence.py
DERIVER OPERATIONAL tools/alpha4_operational_expression.py
DERIVER RELATIONAL tools/alpha4_relational_expression.py
DERIVER CAUSAL tools/alpha4_causal_expression.py

RELATION FOUNDATION NORMALIZED_DECLARATIVE_CLAIM_CONGRUENCE
RELATION THEORY THEORY_ALGEBRA_IMPLEMENTATION_CONGRUENCE
RELATION OPERATIONAL TYPED_OPERATIONAL_SOURCE_PROJECTION_CONGRUENCE
RELATION RELATIONAL DECLARED_RELATION_PROJECTION_CONGRUENCE
RELATION CAUSAL RESTRICTED_CAUSAL_SOURCE_PROJECTION_CONGRUENCE
RELATION ASSEMBLED COMPOSITION_PROJECTION_CONGRUENCE
RELATION PAIRED_GRAPH INDEPENDENT_DERIVATION_CROSS_CONGRUENCE
RELATION PAIRED_RUNTIME THEORY_PREDICTION_BOUNDED_OBSERVATIONAL_CONGRUENCE
RELATION OPERATIONAL_CAUSAL OPERATIONAL_CAUSAL_SOURCE_PROJECTION_CONGRUENCE
RELATION OPERATIONAL_CAUSAL_INTERFACE STACK_EFFECT_EVIDENCE_REQUIREMENT_CONGRUENCE
RELATION RELATIONAL_CAUSAL RELATIONAL_CAUSAL_SOURCE_PROJECTION_CONGRUENCE
RELATION TRIANGULATED_GRAPH THREE_WAY_INDEPENDENT_DERIVATION_CONGRUENCE
RELATION TRIANGULATED_RUNTIME THREE_WAY_BOUNDED_OBSERVATIONAL_CONGRUENCE
